<Slide notes={`老师好，我汇报这两周的进展。先给结论：这轮我没有做出更强的 RUL 预测模型，而是把 RUL 区间怎么报这件事拆开，量化其中多少是方法差异、多少只是报告约定。最后我的构造没有打败一个只有 66 个参数的概率层，但我拿到了三个可复现的偏差量和一个可检测性门槛，说明这个领域很多覆盖率排名在统计上本来就分辨不出来。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 60, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei, Arial', position: 'relative' }}>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 10, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 60, right: 60, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', letterSpacing: 1 }}>IEEE TIM · 测量学研究</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ marginTop: 90, width: 980, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 58, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1.18 }}>RUL 区间的可证明性</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 18 }}>覆盖率、宽度与校准对象</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 96, height: 4, background: '#1E4FA8', marginTop: 30 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 30, lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
      What a Remaining-Useful-Life Interval Can Prove:<br />Coverage, Width, and the Calibration Object
    </Text>
  </Box>
